<mxCell id="c52" value="Bandwidth check: 8 Gbps is 1 GB/s, about 86 TB a day at full rate. At a realistic 60% that is ~50 TB a day,&lt;br&gt;so 420 TB of files is ~9 days of transfer. Planned as 3 weeks with business-hours throttling." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#ED7100;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="34" y="840" width="860" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
